        ("Check your understanding", "text", "Before the basic assessment, you should be able to explain what health research is, how it differs from routine practice or casual information gathering, why the research question comes before the method, why evidence is documented systematically, and why ethics and governance belong in responsible research. If any point is unclear, review the lesson before taking the quiz."),
